<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH ENGINEERING CONCERN SKODA 9MO RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH ENGINEERING CONCERN SKODA 9MO RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period</p>
<p>ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p>CONSOLIDATED RESULTS (comparative figures not available)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 258.174</p>
<p>Result from</p>
<p>  financial operations     -598.380</p>
<p>Result from current</p>
<p>  operations		    455.464</p>
<p>Extraordinary financial</p>
<p>  result			  130.517</p>
<p>Revenues from</p>
<p>  sales of goods	    5,291.496</p>
<p>Revenues from sales of own goods</p>
<p>  and services		6,987.303</p>
<p> Basic capital		9,479.710</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Skoda a.s., a heavy engineering</p>
<p>concern. Results are consolidated.</p>
<p>UNCONSOLIDATED RESULTS</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 282.165</p>
<p> Operational profit	   275.058</p>
<p>Result from</p>
<p>  financial operations	-10.966</p>
<p>Result from current</p>
<p>  operations		    295.443</p>
<p>Extraordinary financial</p>
<p>  result			  -13.278</p>
<p>Revenues from</p>
<p>  sales of goods		 62.490</p>
<p>Revenues from sales of own goods</p>
<p>  and services		  728.295</p>
<p> Basic capital		  9,479.710</p>
<p>Note. Results are unconsolidated.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
